                    "Quicksort picks a pivot, partitions the array around it, then recurses on both sides.",
                    "",
                    "```python",
                    "def quicksort(a):",
                    "    if len(a) <= 1: return a",
                    "    p, rest = a[0], a[1:]",
                    "    return quicksort([x for x in rest if x < p]) + [p] + quicksort([x for x in rest if x >= p])",
                    "```"
                  ]
                }
